<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.58 BILLION.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JUNE LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.58 BILLION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 5.58 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for June 26		     9,900</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for June	     6,350</p>
<p> Average reserves to June 23			  7,159</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,583</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
